      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَبْسَةٌ</span></b>  [<i>A single art of putting on,</i> or <i>wearing,</i> a
garment]. You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَبِسْتُ الثَّوْبَ لَبْسَةً وَاحِدَةً</span>
